{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"稳定子"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"稳定子"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>稳定子是"},{"Local":{"url":"群作用","text":"群作用"}},{"Plain":"中将指定的点变为其自身的子群; 换言之, 是商对象中一个点的自同构群.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设群 $G$ 作用于生象 $X$, 定义点 $x\\in X$ 的<strong>稳定子</strong>为\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Stab}_G(x) := \\Omega(X/G,x).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>由定义,\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\operatorname{Stab}_G(x) &amp;= *\\times_{X/G} *\\\\\r\n    &amp;=*\\times_X (X\\times_{X/G} X)\\times_X *\\\\\r\n    &amp;=*\\times_{X} (X\\times G)\\times_X *\\\\\r\n    &amp;=*\\times_{X\\times X}(X\\times G)\\\\\r\n    &amp;=*\\times_X G.\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n其中用到 $X\\times_{X/G} X = X\\times G$, 因为 $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"群作用","text":"作用"}},{"Plain":"对应 $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"主丛","text":"主丛"}},{"Plain":" $X\\to X/G$.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>轨道–稳定子定理</h3>\n<p>记 $\\operatorname{Orb}_G (x)$ 为 $X/G$ 中 $x$ 所在的连通分支, 则有"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维列","text":"纤维列"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Stab}_G(x) \\to G \\to \\operatorname{Orb}_G (x).\r\n$$\n换言之, $\\operatorname{Orb}_G (x) = G / \\operatorname{Stab}_G (x)$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>群同态的稳定子</h3>\n<p>设 $H,G$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":", 则 $G$ "},{"Local":{"url":"共轭作用","text":"共轭作用"}},{"Plain":"于 $\\operatorname{Hom}(H,G)$ 上, 群同态 $H\\to G$ 在其中的稳定子为"},{"Local":{"url":"中心化子","text":"中心化子"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Stab}_G (H\\to G) = C_G(H).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}